# Build outputs - our own DLL is assembled into the release zip, never committed.
build/
*.dll
# (There used to be a `!profile/plugins/*.dll` exception here for the third-party cutscene plugin,
# which we shipped as content. It was removed 2026-09-08 when our own cutscene fix -- the movie as
# an OpenXR quad, cutscenemono=6 -- replaced it, so no committed DLL belongs in profile/plugins any
# more and the blanket rule above should apply there too.)
*.obj
*.pdb
*.exp
*.lib
